flowchart TD
  A[Input form] --> B[Normalize units]
  B --> C[Validate input]
  C --> D[Resolve material and profile]
  D --> E[Calculate area, mass, resistance]
  E --> F[Apply AC/DC factors]
  F --> G[Calculate losses]
  G --> H[Steady-state thermal solve]
  H --> I[Transient temperature forecast]
  C --> J[Clearance rule lookup]
  J --> K[Channel envelope]
  C --> L[Short-circuit thermal check]
  C --> M[Short-circuit mechanical check]
  I --> N[Aggregate result]
  K --> N
  L --> N
  M --> N
  N --> O[Warnings + status]
  O --> P[UI]
  O --> Q[PDF]
